metadata is not permission to redistribute original, converted or derived weights.
The original UNet is a developer diagnostic reference, not an extra App download.
No standalone LCM import recommendation or product repair is asserted here.

All acquisitions are explicit developer actions. Tests use already verified
assets and never install, download or enable an Android model automatically.
The unchanged CPU sd.cpp/ggml source is pinned in third_party/engine-lock.json.
